# The Vercel build only needs the frontend plus the shared calculator engine.
# `supabase/functions/_shared/engine/client.ts` is imported by the app through the
# `@engine` alias (vite.config.ts and tsconfig.json), so the `supabase` folder
# must be uploaded. Do NOT ignore it.
# Edge functions and the database are deployed with the Supabase CLI instead.
